{"material_id": "ntce.zhongxue.jiaoyuzhishi.2013b.q31.material.recovered", "text": "肖平、王东、高力和赵翔四个人都喜欢踢足球，也爱观看足球比赛。但是他们在观看足球比赛时，情绪表现不一样。当看到自己喜欢的球星踢了一个好球时，肖平立刻大喊“好球！好球！”同时兴奋地手舞足蹈，王东也挺激动，叫好并鼓掌。但是却没有肖平那么狂热，有时还劝告肖平别喊；高力只是平静说了一句，“这球踢得还不错，有水平”，而赵翔则始终沉默不语，会心一笑。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2013年下半年教师资格证考试《教育知识与能力》（中学）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "bbbee3e358fcfcfd89795671c51f6bb0fd296feb9e7fe604111f483aca34fb5f", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2699, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2868, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2013年下半年教师资格证考试《教育知识与能力》（中学）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 31, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "bbbee3e358fcfcfd89795671c51f6bb0fd296feb9e7fe604111f483aca34fb5f"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.zhongxue.jiaoyuzhishi.2013b.q31"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.zhongxue.jiaoyuzhishi.m5.k02"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.zhongxue.ability.care"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.302.r006", "ntce.outline.302.r030", "ntce.outline.302.r031"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.zhongxue.jiaoyuzhishi.2013b.q31"], "word_count": 169, "level": "zhongxue", "subject": "jiaoyuzhishi", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2013年下半年教师资格证考试《教育知识与能力》（中学）真题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2013年下半年教师资格证考试《教育知识与能力》（中学）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "bbbee3e358fcfcfd89795671c51f6bb0fd296feb9e7fe604111f483aca34fb5f", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2699, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2868, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2013年下半年教师资格证考试《教育知识与能力》（中学）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 31, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "bbbee3